# OAuth 2.0 client ID (type "Web application") from the Google Cloud console,
# used to sign the player in to Google Drive for game sync. A client ID is
# public, not a secret. Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development;
# the GitHub Pages deploy reads it from the VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID repository
# variable. It can also be pasted into the app's Drive sync settings instead.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
